// Source: aliyoussefi/MonitoringPowerPlatform/docs/02.02.02 - Monitoring Canvas Apps - Auditing and Activity Logs Part 2.md
// NOTE: This runs against Azure Log Analytics, NOT Application Insights.
// Surfaces Logic Apps / Azure Automation runbook output rows (used for piping
// Office 365 Unified Audit Log entries into Log Analytics).
AzureDiagnostics
| where StreamType_s == "Output"
| project TimeGenerated, ResultDescription
